{"games":[{"id":14565460747,"name":"Copa Roblox 2 | Automatic 🏆","desc":"PC & Mobile - AUTOMATED SOCCER/FOOTBALL GAMES Official Map of Santos Masinha - Copa Roblox (MPS)","path":"/game/14565460747-copa-roblox-2","slug":"14565460747-copa-roblox-2","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0432023bacee792b5b732027359f92a7646820530126c325a132a3b8143612f6.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-4282e8514df8c239ecd6707131a77c68/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":12,"visitor":3355137,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-13T08:19:43.368Z","creator":{"name":"SantosMasinha","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":118855511246658,"name":"Slam Royale","desc":"🗿 Welcome to Slam Royale  🗿\n\n\nSlam your friends in chaotic boulder battles! Swing, launch, and ragdoll your way through the arena in the goofiest, most intense fight of your life.\n\n[How To Play]\n• Equip a boulder from the display!\n• Run into battle and start swinging!\n• Attack players to build up your hit counter!\n• Unlock new boulders with unique abilities!\n\nPlay with friends, collect wild boulders, and dominate the arena 💥","path":"/game/118855511246658-slam-royale","slug":"118855511246658-slam-royale","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9a4d724b7acddf26a183c5d131c75ac109ac9343baafb2b2771e56bfa2432666.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c83d26f88a8c166bc10ae4987bed377f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":12,"visitor":6557191,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-05T04:02:26.998Z","creator":{"name":"Slam Labs","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":87709879486310,"name":"[⚡UPD] Mount JadiJadi","desc":"🌄 Mount JadiJadi (Looking for a Cute Mountain? This is the place!)\nFeel the urge to climb with friends to the top!\n\nThe adventure begins with a beautiful path, overcoming obstacles—from easy to challenging. Every step tells a story, so don't forget to share your best moments with your friends on Mount JadiJadi. Who knows, your experience might inspire others to try this exciting adventure!\n\n✨ Exciting Features:\n+5 SUMMIT!\nFREE SPEEDCOIL!\n🐄 Cow and Shark Rides (Secret: Ride the ⚫Toothless and ⚪Light Fury at the top towards the beach)\nCarrying System (Many interesting options)\nFunny Costumes\nMusic\nAura\nPets\nFunny Sounds\nHot Air Balloons\nEasy Route, very mobile-friendly.\nHold your friends who are struggling to overcome obstacles.\nCollect climbs to the top to unlock special features.\n\n🔥 So, do you want to prove your climbing skills alone, or is it more fun with a team?\nLet's prove it!","path":"/game/87709879486310-mount-jadijadi","slug":"87709879486310-mount-jadijadi","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/160f57f5bca692c93567a9ed2060d42a61c5b09a2e4a94cbcd519fd16fcefe84.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6451f75a5aa20e521711d8f537c3ecc8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":12,"visitor":2013161,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-23T00:13:00.130Z","creator":{"name":"JadiJadi Community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":122165169258616,"name":"[CARRY!] Swiss Mountain: Saxer Lücke","desc":"The Saxer lücke is a 1,650M above sea level pass in the Alpstein Mountains between the Swiss cantons of Appenzell Innerrhoden and St. Gallen . It forms a north-south connection between the Schwende-Rüte district and the municipality of Sennwald in the St. Gallen Rhine Valley .\n\n🛠️The cable car is temporarily remove because it has not been optimized.\n⚠️Not recommended for low end devices, because it includes a showcase map that displays realistic visuals.","path":"/game/122165169258616-swiss-mountain-saxer-lucke","slug":"122165169258616-swiss-mountain-saxer-lucke","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6c9fefd733c6f549e9bc33b19a69996037401d1998b197d14b0d6d1a93c04db2.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ee0ca52233731e1cfdd3dc6fa2adbd3d/150/150/Image/Pn